- op: discuss  # 32b8
  at: '2026-03-03T10:43:46Z'  # 32b8
  by: agent  # 32b8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 32b8
  clock: 6  # 32b8
  nonce: 32b8  # 32b8
  message: "EXTERNAL_DEP_DEEP_PATTERNS already handles Go SDK naming conventions (*-sdk-go*, *-go-sdk, *-sdk-golang*, vendor-internal/). The broader issue (dangling edges to unresolved external calls) is addressed by boundary nodes (WI-sikur, PR #1682). Needs bakeoff revalidation to confirm."  # 32b8
